# Origin of the Express API (server/).
#
# - Browser calls hit /api and /uploads on the Next host; runtime route handlers
#   in app/api and app/uploads forward them here (so the httpOnly auth cookie
#   stays same-origin).
# - Server Components also fetch this origin directly (lib/server-api.js).
#
# Local:      http://localhost:4000
# Production: the HTTPS URL of the deployed API, with NO trailing slash.
#             REQUIRED on Vercel — without it the public site cannot load CMS
#             content and visitors see a "temporarily unavailable" page.
#
# Example:    BACKEND_ORIGIN=https://cybernanet-api.onrender.com
BACKEND_ORIGIN=http://localhost:4000
